<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 544)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Double-click the eraser to clear the frame.</b> The first click still picks the tool, so the pair reads as "erase… no, all of it". The same gesture works in the web review, where a guest clears their own marks.</li>
<li><b>The web review's notes panel folds away</b> — a button beside full screen, or the N key. Three hundred points of sidebar is a lot of picture on a laptop, and the choice is remembered.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
